        "slc_12b8bcfcff4722d17194bc342af1e3384f2491da9f0fd9fa73209a0389a75e9e"
      ],
      "text": "Optional pip dependency groups exist: 'security' (semgrep, depscan) required for AutoFix and DependencyUpgrade, 'rag' (chromadb) required for ResolveIssue, 'notifications' for notification steps, and 'all' which installs everything."
    },
